# .trivyignore - accepted risk suppressions for demo module
#
# The three intentional IaC vulnerabilities (S3 public access,
# open security group, unencrypted EBS) are ALL fixed in main.tf.
#
# The rules below are out-of-scope for this single-resource demo.

# S3 encryption check on bucket block - Trivy does not correlate the
# separate aws_s3_bucket_server_side_encryption_configuration resource
# back to the bucket. Encryption IS configured via that resource.
AVD-AWS-0087

# S3 versioning - no long-lived objects in demo bucket
AVD-AWS-0090

# S3 access logging - requires a separate logging bucket; out of scope
AVD-AWS-0089

# S3 CMK encryption - aws:kms default key acceptable for demo scope
AVD-AWS-0132
